                <invention-title lang="fr">ADHÉSIF RENFORCÉ ET PROCÉDÉ DE LIAISON FAISANT APPEL À CE DERNIER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">TOUGHENED ADHESIVE AND BONDING METHOD USING THE SAME</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A bonding method for joining two structural parts using a curable adhesive layer having a fibrous veil embedded therein. The fibrous veil carries a polymeric binder, which is in a solid phase at room temperature (20°C-25°C) and is capable of dissolving into the adhesive composition during curing thereof.</p>
